	  ]
	},
	{
	  "name": "LoadText",
	  "speaker": "Narrator",
	  "segments": [
		{
		  "text": "William can feel a shiver on his feet, as if something is nuzzling his legs. And when he looks down, he can see an Irish Wolfhound nuzzling its head onto his leg. ",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "But the dog's flesh is rotten, with its organs showing, creating a very sharp smell in the small, dimly-lit basement.",
