		  "text": "Out of instinct, William immediately steps back in shock, his eyes wide with fear. ",
		  "pacing": 0.045,
		  "style": "narration",
		  "pause_after": 0.3
		},
		{
		  "text": "But as he looks closely at the dog, there's an undertone of familiarity that stings at the corner of his memories as he fights back tears.",
